{"title": "Hellish Sphere (Aura) (Condition)", "pageid": 40310, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hellish_Sphere_(Aura)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flaming Sphere Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Hellish Sphere</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Enemies and objects within 3 m (10 ft) of the sphere at the end of their turn take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>. On a successful save, they still take half damage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">FLAMING_SPHERE_AURA</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CFLAMING_SPHERE_AURA%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CFLAMING_SPHERE_AURA%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/InitiateCombat\" title=\"Status properties/InitiateCombat\">InitiateCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/BringIntoCombat\" title=\"Status properties/BringIntoCombat\">BringIntoCombat</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Hellish_Sphere\">Condition: Hellish Sphere</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Hellish Sphere (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Hellish_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Hellish Sphere (Condition)\">Hellish Sphere</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;3 m (10 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Creature is standing within 3 m (10 ft) of a flaming sphere and will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage at the end of its turn. On a second save, it will still take half damage.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> save, based on the user's <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> Spell Save DC.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>FLAMING_SPHERE_AURA</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Flaming_Sphere\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Flaming Sphere (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flaming Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Flaming Sphere (Condition)\">Flaming Sphere</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Enemies and objects within 1.5 m (5 ft) of the sphere at end of their turn take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage. On a successful save, it still takes half damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hellish_Sphere\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Sphere_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Hellish Sphere (Aura) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Flaming_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hellish Sphere</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Enemies and objects within 3 m (10 ft) of the sphere at the end of their turn take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>. On a successful save, they still take half damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715162152\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2273/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29083/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7844/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1246420/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   68.170      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   68.170      1 -total\n 41.58%   28.348      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 19.85%   13.529      7 Template:Icon_text\n 18.90%   12.886      6 Template:Icon_link\n 18.61%   12.685      1 Template:PageSeo\n 18.04%   12.299     28 Template:Trim\n 12.32%    8.402      1 Template:Condition\n 12.31%    8.392      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 12.13%    8.268      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40310-0!canonical and timestamp 2026